  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Enslavement path splits from soul path, and combining it with the immemorial wisdom path is what lets enslavement path become an independent path.",
      "chapters": [
        442
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "path_enslavement"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wisdom path begins from how a mind works. When a person thinks, thoughts appear, collide, fuse, or cancel, and that process is the path’s basic material.",
      "chapters": [
        570
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The path seeks knowledge and is split into thought, will, and emotion. Thought is the foundation. Many thoughts gather into will. Many wills intertwine into emotion.",
      "chapters": [
        570
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "thought-will-and-emotion",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Thoughts are easy to create and destroy. Emotion is the hardest of the three to cut away.",
      "chapters": [
        574
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "thought-will-and-emotion",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Will is harder to create than thought, and once formed it can move independently and be recalled later.",
      "chapters": [
        598
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "thought-will-and-emotion",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wisdom path originated from Star Constellation Immortal Venerable and has existed since the Remote Antiquity Era. Few Gu Masters cultivate it, yet the path has never died out.",
      "chapters": [
        580
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "origin-and-rarity",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable",
        "evt_era_remote",
        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A later speaker names her the creator of wisdom path outright.",
      "chapters": [
        788
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "origin-and-rarity",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wisdom Gu at rank nine gives off the light of wisdom. Under that light, thoughts form, collide, and break at extreme speed. The novel states that wisdom path became one of the paths of Gu Masters from that principle of thinking.",
      "chapters": [
        637
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "light-of-wisdom",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_wisdom_gu"
      ]
    }
  ],
